OL,3,GNEWSAMan has earlobe bitten off in
OL,4,Astation car park attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man had his earlobe bitten off in a
OL,7,Fserious assault in West Sussex, police
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FOfficers said the attack happened at
OL,11,FChichester railway station car park at
OL,12,Fabout 19:20 BST on 26 June.
OL,14,FMembers of the public stepped in to
OL,15,Fhelp and the man was taken to hospital,
OL,16,FBritish Transport Police said.
OL,18,FThe force has released images of two
OL,19,Fmen they believe could have information
OL,20,Fthat may assist their investigation.
